    "## Train four adapter variants\n",
    "\n",
    "LoRA, TinyLoRA, and DoRA load the base model in 4-bit. DeLoRA loads full BF16/FP16 weights because\n",
    "its initialization computes norms over the original floating-point weights.\n"
   ]
